{
    "quest": {
        "id": "76035",
        "title": "Her Past",
        "description": "The Damselette appears to have some interesting things to share at the Silvermoon Hall...",
        "rewards": [],
        "rewards_formatted": "",
        "chapter": {
            "icon": "",
            "id": "",
            "num": "",
            "title": ""
        },
        "total_dialogue_lines": 45,
        "total_speaker_counts": {
            "Paimon": 8,
            "Player": 15,
            "The Damselette": 22
        }
    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7603501",
            "objective": "Meet The Damselette",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "760350101",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "(Is Columbina... not in?)"
                },
                {
                    "id": "760350102",
                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                    "text": "Looking for me?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "760350103",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Waaah!",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "760350104",
                            "text": "You scared me...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "760350106",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "After sensing your arrival, I wanted to see how close I could get to you from behind."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350107",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Because you have nothing better to do, or...?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350108",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "Hm... Is that how it seems? No different than when I was with the Fatui, then... There was never much for me to do."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350109",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "The Tsaritsa only sought the power of the Moon Goddesses. I was never dispatched to seize a Gnosis or anything like that."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350110",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "So what would you do to pass the time?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350111",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "Take walks, watch the moon, sometimes sing... But, I came to do that last one less and less after Sandrone forbade it."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350112",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hmm? She didn't like your singing?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350113",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "No. She praised it, actually. But, I had only recently joined the Fatui then, and she said my singing set the others on edge."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350114",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "Because, for those not in the know, it seemed like I was about to use... some sort of power."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350115",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Oh, huh... Paimon can sort of understand that."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350116",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "Oh, and there was another reason. She said she did most of her research at night, so if I sang during the day, it would disturb her attempts to catch up on sleep."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350117",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "(This was the main reason, I'll bet!)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350118",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "So, I used to just sing outside her door at night instead. But, still. She always chased me away..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350119",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350120",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "Did you get along with the others?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350121",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "\"Get along\"? Hmm... When we first met, Arlecchino did seem eager to \"get along\" with me."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350122",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "She often showed up behind me without making a sound, like I did to you earlier. She said it was an attempt to \"test\" me, I believe."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350123",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "I, too, attempted to join in on the game, but she always managed to spot me before I even got close."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350124",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "Eventually, I resorted to using kuuvahki and managed to give her quite a scare from behind. But, she never played that game with me again after that."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350125",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "(Yeah, Paimon doubts that was a \"game\" to the Knave at all...)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350126",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "What else... Oh, The Doctor often asked me to assist in his Light Realm-related research."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "760350127",
                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                    "text": "I obliged him a few times, but it was so dull. \"Use kuuvahki to strike this,\" \"use kuuvahki to control that\"... I stopped going after a while.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "760350128",
                                            "text": "Looks like you're in a good mood today...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "760350130",
                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                    "text": "Yes. Even though I've \"run away from home,\" I do have some fond memories of it all the same."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "760350131",
                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                    "text": "Arlecchino and Sandrone treated me quite well, along with..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "760350132",
                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                    "text": "..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "760350133",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "(That expression... I wonder who she's thinking about...)"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "760350134",
                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                    "text": "Give me your hand.",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "760350135",
                                                            "text": "...Huh?",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350137",
                                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                                    "text": "Rosalyne taught me... It's important to always express gratitude to others."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350138",
                                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                                    "text": "So, thank you for listening to me."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350139",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "Don't mention it..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350140",
                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                    "text": "(Is this... the Moon Goddess's Favor?)"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350141",
                                                                    "speaker": "The Damselette",
                                                                    "text": "I believe that's enough for today."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "760350142",
                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                    "text": "Whoa, that was sudden!",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "760350143",
                                                                            "text": "Shh... Paimon...",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "760350145",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "Yeah, guess you're right. Well, let's not bother her, then."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "760350144",
                                                                            "text": "She's remembering certain things from her past, I think..."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "760350136",
                                                            "text": "...Why?"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "760350129",
                                            "text": "You spoke quite a bit about your past..."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "760350105",
                            "text": "You really had to pop up from behind like that...?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}